<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>清治法 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B8%85%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/</link><description>Recent content in 清治法 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 15:59:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E6%B8%85%E6%B2%BB%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>清治法：论脉燥</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-13-qingzhifa/</link><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 15:56:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-13-qingzhifa/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“清治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;肺气燥咳&lt;/strong&gt;不可妄用凉药、而当用&lt;strong&gt;清平滋润&lt;/strong&gt;之剂的法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;肺居上焦而畏寒，燥极成火，若直用凉药则寒伤脾胃，变生泻利。故以清平之品平补胃口、上清肺金，使胃气不伤而肺得濡养&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>